class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed-Paced ASMR STYLE Clicker Gameplay: Process a handful of faxes, then take a well-earned \u201cvacation\u201d (or hide in plain sight).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero Hand-Holding: No tutorial pop-ups, no UI clutter\u2014just you, your stamps, and your survival instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satirical News Breaks: Fill in the gaps with your own commentary as absurd headlines roll across the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth LOFI style details in a lived-in and lifelike space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEI and woke, tongue-in-cheek comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Review It. Approve or Deny. File It. VACATION!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to master the madness\u2014and get away clean?</p>",
